  "body": {
    "type": "doc",
    "content": [
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "This makes 2 large tarts serving 4 and takes about 1 hour including resting. The thing to watch is the oven: it must be as hot as your oven will go, ideally 240C or higher. A cold oven gives you a pale, soggy base rather than a crisp, blistered one."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Roll the dough as thin as you can. Tarte flambee should be almost cracker-thin at the edges. Thick dough is the main reason home versions disappoint."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "attrs": {
          "level": 2
        },
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "What you need"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "ingredientsList",
        "attrs": {
          "defaultServings": 4,
          "items": [
            {
              "ingredientSlug": "plain-flour",
              "amount": 250,
              "unit": "g",
              "prepNote": "plus extra for rolling",
              "isOptional": false,
              "groupLabel": "Dough"
            },
            {
              "ingredientSlug": "olive-oil",
              "amount": 2,
              "unit": "tbsp",
              "prepNote": null,
              "isOptional": false,
              "groupLabel": "Dough"
            },
            {
              "ingredientSlug": "water",
              "amount": 125,
              "unit": "ml",
              "prepNote": "warm",
              "isOptional": false,
              "groupLabel": "Dough"
            },
            {
              "ingredientSlug": "creme-fraiche",
              "amount": 200,
              "unit": "g",
              "prepNote": null,
              "isOptional": false,
              "groupLabel": "Topping"
            },
            {
